MSG_THE_WITCH_S_TALE equ 21600    ; "The Witch's Tale"
MSG_ONCE_UPON_A_TIME_THER_21601 equ 21601; "!Once upon a time there was a goodly witch by the name of"
MSG_HILYNDA_WHO_WAS_VERY_21602 equ 21602; "Hilynda, who was very powerful and beautiful. She lived high"
MSG_UPON_A_MOUNTAIN_TOP_A_21603 equ 21603; "upon a mountain top, and ruled all the lands below her as far as"
MSG_THE_EYE_COULD_SEE_BEI_21604 equ 21604; "the eye could see. Being a fair and just witch, she was provider"
MSG_AND_BENEFACTOR_TO_ALL_21605 equ 21605; "and benefactor to all the animals dwelli"
MSG_AND_OFTEN_APPEARED_TO_21606 equ 21606; "and often appeared to passing strangers in times of need. She"
MSG_HAD_BEEN_BORNE_OF_PAR_21607 equ 21607; "had been borne of parents who also were witches, and had inherited"
MSG_THE_POWER_TO_FORETELL_21608 equ 21608; "the power to foretell the future, a very rare and special gift, even"
MSG_FOR_A_WITCH_BUT_COMIN_21609 equ 21609; "for a witch. But coming from a family of witches, she was not an"
MSG_ONLY_CHILD_FOUR_SISTE_21610 equ 21610; "only child. Four sisters, envious of her beauty and jealous of her"
MSG_POWER_ALSO_LIVED_IN_T_21611 equ 21611; "power, also lived in the mountains. And as every day passed, they"
MSG_BECAME_MORE_AND_MORE_21612 equ 21612; "became more and more resentful of her popularity and her goodness."
MSG_SO_THE_FOUR_SISTERS_B_21613 equ 21613; "So the four sisters banded together, and decided that they would"
MSG_UNDO_ALL_THE_GOOD_THA_21614 equ 21614; "undo all the good that Hilynda had done, and torment her, and"
MSG_BE_JUST_AS_NASTY_AS_T_21615 equ 21615; "be just as nasty as they could. And the four sisters took upon"
MSG_THEMSELVES_THE_NAMES_21616 equ 21616; "themselves the names of the North, the South, the East, and the"
MSG_WEST_SO_THAT_THEY_WOU_21617 equ 21617; "West, so that they would cover all the lands around them and"
MSG_INSURE_THAT_NO_FOUL_D_21618 equ 21618; "insure that no foul deed would go undone. But for every dirty"
MSG_TRICK_FOR_EVERY_HEINO_21619 equ 21619; "trick, for every heinous crime, for every little bit of badness"
MSG_THAT_THEY_COULD_DO_HI_21620 equ 21620; "that they could do, Hilynda was always there to thwart them, and"
MSG_TURN_THEIR_HORRIBLE_D_21621 equ 21621; "turn their horrible deeds into good ones. For remember, Hilynda"
MSG_COULD_SEE_INTO_THE_FU_21622 equ 21622; "could see into the future and always knew what her sisters were"
MSG_GOING_TO_DO_EVEN_BEFO_21623 equ 21623; "going to do, even before they themselves knew! And so the day"
MSG_FINALLY_CAME_WHEN_THE_21624 equ 21624; "finally came when the four sisters said enough was enough and"
MSG_THE_TIME_HAD_COME_FOR_21625 equ 21625; "the time had come for them to put a stop to Hilynda once and"
MSG_FOR_ALL_ONE_NIGHT_WHI_21626 equ 21626; "for all. One night, while Hilynda lay sleeping, dreaming of"
MSG_GOOD_THINGS_THEY_SNEA_21627 equ 21627; "good things, they sneaked into her chamber and invoked a"
MSG_TERRIBLE_MAGIC_SPELL_21628 equ 21628; "terrible magic spell upon her: they cast a spell to steal her"
MSG_FACE_HER_BEAUTIFUL_FA_21629 equ 21629; "face! Her beautiful face, her nose, her"
MSG_MOUTH_HER_EARS_AND_HER_E equ 21630; "mouth, her ears and her e"
MSG_FROM_HER_AND_EACH_OF_21631 equ 21631; "from her: and each of the sisters took a part of Hilynda's"
MSG_FACE_SO_THAT_THEN_THE_21632 equ 21632; "face, so that then they would all have a share of their sister's"
MSG_MAGICAL_POWER_AND_OF_21633 equ 21633; "magical power, and of her beauty. But Hilynda was wise to them,"
MSG_AND_HAD_FORESEEN_WHAT_21634 equ 21634; "and had foreseen what her sisters had been planning to do,"
MSG_AND_THAT_NIGHT_BEFORE_21635 equ 21635; "and that night, before she slept, she annointed"
MSG_HERSELF_WITH_A_SPECIA_21636 equ 21636; "herself with a special potion, which turned her face into gold!"
MSG_AND_WHEN_HER_MOUTH_HE_21637 equ 21637; "And when her mouth, her nose, her ears, and her eyes were"
MSG_STOLEN_IT_DID_NOT_HUR_21638 equ 21638; "stolen, it did not hurt her and she did not die: and because"
MSG_HER_FEATURES_WERE_NO_21639 equ 21639; "her features were no longer of flesh and blood, each of the four"
MSG_SISTER_S_OWN_FACE_WAS_21640 equ 21640; "sister's own face was replaced with a part of gold. But Hilynda"
MSG_WAS_CUT_OFF_FROM_THE_21641 equ 21641; "was cut off from the outside world, alone, and with no face."
MSG_THE_FOUR_SISTERS_NOW_21642 equ 21642; "The four sisters now rule the mountains, and terrorize the"
MSG_SURROUNDING_LANDS_AND_21643 equ 21643; "surrounding lands, and do all kinds of horrible things. And"
MSG_TO_REPAY_HILYNDA_FOR_21644 equ 21644; "to repay Hilynda for her cleverness, and cursing them with"
MSG_A_FEATURE_OF_GOLD_EVE_21645 equ 21645; "a feature of gold, every night they torment her, sending demons"
MSG_AND_SPOOKS_AND_GHOULS_21646 equ 21646; "and spooks and ghouls and fiends to poke and tear at her, and"
MSG_MAKE_HER_FEEL_JUST_AW_21647 equ 21647; "make her feel just awful. They say that the five sisters still"
MSG_LIVE_IN_THOSE_MOUNTAI_21648 equ 21648; "live in those mountains, and that every night, just before"
MSG_THE_WITCHING_HOUR_IF_21649 equ 21649; "the witching hour, if you look through a witching glass, you can"
MSG_SEE_THE_SPIRITS_COME_21650 equ 21650; "see the spirits come down into the forest, dancing"
MSG_THEIR_DANCE_OF_TORTUR_21651 equ 21651; "their dance of torture, cruelty and pain around Hilynda, and that"
MSG_TO_THIS_VERY_DAY_SHE_21652 equ 21652; "to this very day she still roams the mountains, waiting for someone"
MSG_TO_MAKE_HER_WHOLE_AND_21653 equ 21653; "to make her whole and beautiful again, waiting for someone to"
MSG_BRING_BACK_HER_FACE equ 21654 ; "bring back her face."
